===Etymology===
{{confix|psychro|meter}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{meteorology}} Any of several instruments used to measure the [[relative humidity]] of the [[atmosphere]]; especially a [[wet-and-dry-bulb hygrometer]].

